4 Development mode
******************

When writing your code, we recommend enabling Python’s development
mode(1) (‘python -X dev’).  In addition to the extra features enabled
for asyncio, aiohttp will:

   - Use a strict parser in the client code (which can help detect
     malformed responses from a server).

   - Enable some additional checks (resulting in warnings in certain
     situations).

