13.2.2.1 Unicode support
........................

'aiohttp' does *note requoting: 34. of incoming request path.

Unicode (non-ASCII) symbols are processed transparently on both 'route
adding' and 'resolving' (internally everything is converted to *note
percent-encoding: 1dd. form by *note yarl: 1de. library).

But in case of custom regular expressions for *note Variable Resources:
1b1. please take care that URL is 'percent encoded': if you pass Unicode
patterns they don’t match to 'requoted' path.


