13.2.2.12 Request’s storage
...........................

Variables that are only needed for the lifetime of a *note Request: 19b,
can be stored in a *note Request: 19b.:

     async def handler(request):
       request['my_private_key'] = "data"
       ...

This is mostly useful for *note Middlewares: d. and *note Signals: e.
handlers to store data for further processing by the next handlers in
the chain.


