13.2.2.13 Response’s storage
............................

*note StreamResponse: 1a5. and *note Response: 19c. objects also support
collections.abc.MutableMapping(1) interface.  This is useful when you
want to share data with signals and middlewares once all the work in the
handler is done:

     async def handler(request):
       [ do all the work ]
       response['my_metric'] = 123
       return response

