13.2.2.14 Naming hint
.....................

To avoid clashing with other 'aiohttp' users and third-party libraries,
please choose a unique key name for storing data.

If your code is published on PyPI, then the project name is most likely
unique and safe to use as the key.  Otherwise, something based on your
company name/url would be satisfactory (i.e.  ‘org.company.app’).


