13.2.2.25 Application runners
.............................

*note run_app(): 19e. provides a simple 'blocking' API for running an
*note Application: 19d.

For starting the application 'asynchronously' or serving on multiple
HOST/PORT *note AppRunner: 215. exists.

The simple startup code for serving HTTP site on ‘'localhost'’, port
‘8080’ looks like:

     runner = web.AppRunner(app)
     await runner.setup()
     site = web.TCPSite(runner, 'localhost', 8080)
     await site.start()

     while True:
         await asyncio.sleep(3600)  # sleep forever

To stop serving call *note AppRunner.cleanup(): 216.:

     await runner.cleanup()

Added in version 3.0.


