13.2.2.34 Debug Toolbar
.......................

aiohttp-debugtoolbar(1) is a very useful library that provides a
debugging toolbar while you’re developing an *note aiohttp.web: 3.
application.

Install it with ‘pip’:

     $ pip install aiohttp_debugtoolbar

Just call ‘aiohttp_debugtoolbar.setup()’:

     import aiohttp_debugtoolbar
     from aiohttp_debugtoolbar import toolbar_middleware_factory

     app = web.Application()
     aiohttp_debugtoolbar.setup(app)

The toolbar is ready to use.  Enjoy!!!

