13.2.4.11 Running Applications
..............................

To start web application there is ‘AppRunner’ and site classes.

Runner is a storage for running application, sites are for running
application on specific TCP or Unix socket, e.g.:

     runner = web.AppRunner(app)
     await runner.setup()
     site = web.TCPSite(runner, 'localhost', 8080)
     await site.start()
     # wait for finish signal
     await runner.cleanup()

Added in version 3.0: *note AppRunner: 215. / *note ServerRunner: 2f0.
and *note TCPSite: 2f1. / *note UnixSite: 2f2. / *note SockSite: 2f3.
are added in aiohttp 3.0

