13.2.6.1 Testing aiohttp web servers
....................................

aiohttp provides plugin for 'pytest' making writing web server tests
extremely easy, it also provides *note test framework agnostic
utilities: 31d. for testing with other frameworks such as *note
unittest: 31e.

Before starting to write your tests, you may also be interested on
reading *note how to write testable services: 31f. that interact with
the loop.

For using pytest plugin please install pytest-aiohttp(1) library:

     $ pip install pytest-aiohttp

If you don’t want to install 'pytest-aiohttp' for some reason you may
insert ‘pytest_plugins = 'aiohttp.pytest_plugin'’ line into
‘conftest.py’ instead for the same functionality.

