13.2.6.2 The Test Client and Servers
....................................

'aiohttp' test utils provides a scaffolding for testing aiohttp-based
web servers.

They are consist of two parts: running test server and making HTTP
requests to this server.

*note TestServer: 321. runs *note aiohttp.web.Application: 19d. based
server, *note RawTestServer: 322. starts *note aiohttp.web.Server: 234.
low level server.

For performing HTTP requests to these servers you have to create a test
client: *note TestClient: 323. instance.

The client incapsulates *note aiohttp.ClientSession: 2e. by providing
proxy methods to the client for common operations such as 'ws_connect',
'get', 'post', etc.


