     Abstract 'match info', returned by *note
     aiohttp.abc.AbstractRouter.resolve(): 29e. call.

      -- Attribute: http_exception

          *note aiohttp.web.HTTPException: 1d8. if no match was found,
          ‘None’ otherwise.

      -- Method: async handler (request)

          Abstract method performing *note web-handler: 19f. processing.


          Parameters: ‘request’ – *note aiohttp.web.Request: 19b.
          instance for resolving, the request has *note
          aiohttp.web.Request.match_info: 1b3. equals to ‘None’ at
