13.3.5.1 FrozenList
...................

A list-like structure which implements
collections.abc.MutableSequence(1).

The list is 'mutable' unless *note FrozenList.freeze(): 3cd. is called,
after that the list modification raises RuntimeError(2).

 -- Class: aiohttp.FrozenList (items)

     Construct a new 'non-frozen' list from 'items' iterable.

     The list implements all collections.abc.MutableSequence(3) methods
     plus two additional APIs.

      -- Attribute: frozen

          A read-only property, ‘True’ is the list is 'frozen'
          (modifications are forbidden).

      -- Method: freeze ()

          Freeze the list.  There is no way to 'thaw' it back.

