13.3.5.2 ChainMapProxy
......................

An 'immutable' version of collections.ChainMap(1).  Internally the proxy
is a list of mappings (dictionaries), if the requested key is not
present in the first mapping the second is looked up and so on.

The class supports collections.abc.Mapping(2) interface.

