13.4.2 Does aiohttp have a concept like Flask’s “blueprint” or Django’s “app”?
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you’re writing a large application, you may want to consider using
*note nested applications: 1f5, which are similar to Flask’s
“blueprints” or Django’s “apps”.

See: *note Nested applications: 1f5.


