13.5.3.5 Bug fixes
..................

   - Fixed proxy authorization headers not being passed when reusing a
     connection, which caused 407 (Proxy authentication required) errors
     – by @GLeurquin(1).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #2596(2).

   - Fixed multipart reading failing when encountering an empty body
     part – by @Dreamsorcerer(3).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #11857(4).

   - Fixed a case where the parser wasn’t raising an exception for a
     websocket continuation frame when there was no initial frame in
     context.

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #11862(5).

   ---------- Footnotes ----------

   (1) https://github.com/sponsors/GLeurquin

   (2) https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/issues/2596

   (3) https://github.com/sponsors/Dreamsorcerer

   (4) https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/issues/11857

   (5) https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/issues/11862


