13.5.3.11 Bug fixes
...................

   - Fixed cookie parser to continue parsing subsequent cookies when
     encountering a malformed cookie that fails regex validation, such
     as Google’s ‘g_state’ cookie with unescaped quotes – by @bdraco(1).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #11632(2).

