     version will be used.

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #9068(10).

   - Improved performance of checking if a host is an IP Address – by
     @bdraco(11).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #9095(12).

   - Significantly improved performance of middlewares – by @bdraco(13).

     The construction of the middleware wrappers is now cached and is
     built once per handler instead of on every request.

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #9158(14), #9170(15).

   - Improved performance of web requests – by @bdraco(16).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #9168(17), #9169(18),
     #9172(19), #9174(20), #9175(21), #9241(22).

   - Improved performance of starting web requests when there is no
     response prepare hook – by @bdraco(23).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #9173(24).

