13.5.3.171 Features
...................

   - Added a Request.wait_for_disconnection() method, as means of
     allowing request handlers to be notified of premature client
     disconnections.

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #2492(1).

   - Added 5 new exceptions: *note InvalidUrlClientError: 12c, *note
     RedirectClientError: 12d, *note NonHttpUrlClientError: 12e, *note
     InvalidUrlRedirectClientError: 12f, *note
     NonHttpUrlRedirectClientError: 130.

     *note InvalidUrlRedirectClientError: 12f, *note
     NonHttpUrlRedirectClientError: 130. are raised instead of
     ValueError(2) or *note InvalidURL: 129. when the redirect URL is
     invalid.  Classes *note InvalidUrlClientError: 12c, *note
     RedirectClientError: 12d, *note NonHttpUrlClientError: 12e. are
     base for them.

     The *note InvalidURL: 129. now exposes a ‘description’ property
     with the text explanation of the error details.

     – by @setla(3), @AraHaan(4), and @bdraco(5)

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #2507(6), #3315(7),
     #6722(8), #8481(9), #8482(10).

   - Added a feature to retry closed connections automatically for
     idempotent methods.  – by @Dreamsorcerer(11)

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #7297(12).

   - Implemented filter_cookies() with domain-matching and path-matching
     on the keys, instead of testing every single cookie.  This may
     break existing cookies that have been saved with
     ‘CookieJar.save()’.  Cookies can be migrated with this script:

          import pickle
          with file_path.open("rb") as f:
              cookies = pickle.load(f)

          morsels = [(name, m) for c in cookies.values() for name, m in c.items()]
          cookies.clear()
          for name, m in morsels:
              cookies[(m["domain"], m["path"].rstrip("/"))][name] = m

          with file_path.open("wb") as f:
              pickle.dump(cookies, f, pickle.HIGHEST_PROTOCOL)

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #7583(13), #8535(14).

   - Separated connection and socket timeout errors, from
     ServerTimeoutError.

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #7801(15).

   - Implemented happy eyeballs

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #7954(16).

   - Added server capability to check for static files with Brotli
     compression via a ‘.br’ extension – by @steverep(17).

     'Related issues and pull requests on GitHub:' #8062(18).

