13.5.3.199 Features
...................

   - Introduced ‘AppKey’ for static typing support of ‘Application’
     storage.  See
     ‘https://docs.aiohttp.org/en/stable/web_advanced.html#application-s-config’

     #5864(1)

   - Added a graceful shutdown period which allows pending tasks to
     complete before the application’s cleanup is called.  The period
     can be adjusted with the ‘shutdown_timeout’ parameter.  – by
     @Dreamsorcerer(2).  See
     ‘https://docs.aiohttp.org/en/latest/web_advanced.html#graceful-shutdown’

     #7188(3)

   - Added handler_cancellation(4) parameter to cancel web handler on
     client disconnection.  – by @mosquito(5) This (optionally)
     reintroduces a feature removed in a previous release.  Recommended
     for those looking for an extra level of protection against
     denial-of-service attacks.

     #7056(6)

   - Added support for setting response header parameters
     ‘max_line_size’ and ‘max_field_size’.

     #2304(7)

   - Added ‘auto_decompress’ parameter to ‘ClientSession.request’ to
     override ‘ClientSession._auto_decompress’.  – by @Daste745(8)

     #3751(9)

   - Changed ‘raise_for_status’ to allow a coroutine.

     #3892(10)

   - Added client brotli compression support (optional with runtime
     check).

     #5219(11)

   - Added ‘client_max_size’ to ‘BaseRequest.clone()’ to allow
     overriding the request body size.  – @anesabml(12).

     #5704(13)

   - Added a middleware type alias ‘aiohttp.typedefs.Middleware’.

     #5898(14)

   - Exported ‘HTTPMove’ which can be used to catch any redirection
     request that has a location – @dreamsorcerer(15).

     #6594(16)

   - Changed the ‘path’ parameter in ‘web.run_app()’ to accept a
     ‘pathlib.Path’ object.

     #6839(17)

   - Performance: Skipped filtering ‘CookieJar’ when the jar is empty or
     all cookies have expired.

     #7819(18)

   - Performance: Only check origin if insecure scheme and there are
     origins to treat as secure, in ‘CookieJar.filter_cookies()’.

     #7821(19)

   - Performance: Used timestamp instead of ‘datetime’ to achieve faster
     cookie expiration in ‘CookieJar’.

     #7824(20)

   - Added support for passing a custom server name parameter to HTTPS
     connection.

     #7114(21)

   - Added support for using Basic Auth credentials from ‘.netrc’ file
     when making HTTP requests with the *note ClientSession: 2e.
     ‘trust_env’ argument is set to ‘True’.  – by @yuvipanda(22).

     #7131(23)

   - Turned access log into no-op when the logger is disabled.

     #7240(24)

   - Added typing information to ‘RawResponseMessage’.  – by
     @Gobot1234(25)

     #7365(26)

   - Removed ‘async-timeout’ for Python 3.11+ (replaced with
     ‘asyncio.timeout()’ on newer releases).

     #7502(27)

   - Added support for ‘brotlicffi’ as an alternative to ‘brotli’
     (fixing Brotli support on PyPy).

     #7611(28)

   - Added ‘WebSocketResponse.get_extra_info()’ to access a protocol
     transport’s extra info.

     #7078(29)

   - Allow ‘link’ argument to be set to None/empty in HTTP 451
     exception.

     #7689(30)

