13.5.3.227 Features
...................

   - Added a ‘GunicornWebWorker’ feature for extending the aiohttp
     server configuration by allowing the ‘wsgi’ coroutine to return
     ‘web.AppRunner’ object.  #2988(1)

   - Switch from ‘http-parser’ to ‘llhttp’ #3561(2)

   - Use Brotli instead of brotlipy #3803(3)

   - Disable implicit switch-back to pure python mode.  The build fails
     loudly if aiohttp cannot be compiled with C Accelerators.  Use
     AIOHTTP_NO_EXTENSIONS=1 to explicitly disable C Extensions
     complication and switch to Pure-Python mode.  Note that Pure-Python
     mode is significantly slower than compiled one.  #3828(4)

   - Make access log use local time with timezone #3853(5)

   - Implemented ‘readuntil’ in ‘StreamResponse’ #4054(6)

   - FileResponse now supports ETag.  #4594(7)

   - Add a request handler type alias ‘aiohttp.typedefs.Handler’.
     #4686(8)

   - ‘AioHTTPTestCase’ is more async friendly now.

     For people who use unittest and are used to use TestCase(9) it will
     be easier to write new test cases like the sync version of the
     TestCase(10) class, without using the decorator
     ‘@unittest_run_loop’, just ‘async def test_*’.  The only difference
     is that for the people using python3.7 and below a new dependency
     is needed, it is ‘asynctestcase’.  #4700(11)

   - Add validation of HTTP header keys and values to prevent header
     injection.  #4818(12)

   - Add predicate to ‘AbstractCookieJar.clear’.  Add
     ‘AbstractCookieJar.clear_domain’ to clean all domain and subdomains
     cookies only.  #4942(13)

   - Add keepalive_timeout parameter to web.run_app.  #5094(14)

   - Tracing for client sent headers #5105(15)

   - Make type hints for http parser stricter #5267(16)

   - Add final declarations for constants.  #5275(17)

   - Switch to external frozenlist and aiosignal libraries.  #5293(18)

   - Don’t send secure cookies by insecure transports.

     By default, the transport is secure if https or wss scheme is used.
     Use ‘CookieJar(treat_as_secure_origin=”http://127.0.0.1”)’ to
     override the default security checker.  #5571(19)

   - Always create a new event loop in ‘aiohttp.web.run_app()’.  This
     adds better compatibility with ‘asyncio.run()’ or if trying to run
     multiple apps in sequence.  #5572(20)

   - Add ‘aiohttp.pytest_plugin.AiohttpClient’ for static typing of
     pytest plugin.  #5585(21)

   - Added a ‘socket_factory’ argument to ‘BaseTestServer’.  #5844(22)

   - Add compression strategy parameter to enable_compression method.
     #5909(23)

   - Added support for Python 3.10 to Github Actions CI/CD workflows and
     fix the related deprecation warnings – @Hanaasagi(24).  #5927(25)

   - Switched ‘chardet’ to ‘charset-normalizer’ for guessing the HTTP
     payload body encoding – @Ousret(26).  #5930(27)

   - Added optional auto_decompress argument for HttpRequestParser
     #5957(28)

   - Added support for HTTPS proxies to the extent CPython’s asyncio(29)
     supports it – by @bmbouter(30), @jborean93(31) and @webknjaz(32).
     #5992(33)

   - Added ‘base_url’ parameter to the initializer of *note
     ClientSession: 2e.  #6013(34)

   - Add Trove classifier and create binary wheels for 3.10.  –
     @hugovk(35).  #6079(36)

   - Started shipping platform-specific wheels with the ‘musl’ tag
     targeting typical Alpine Linux runtimes — @asvetlov(37).  #6139(38)

   - Started shipping platform-specific arm64 wheels for Apple Silicon —
     @asvetlov(39).  #6139(40)

