13.5.3.262 Bugfixes
...................

   - Raise a ClientResponseError instead of an AssertionError for a
     blank HTTP Reason Phrase.  #3532(1)

   - Fix an issue where cookies would sometimes not be set during a
     redirect.  #3576(2)

   - Change normalize_path_middleware to use 308 redirect instead of
     301.

     This behavior should prevent clients from being unable to use
     PUT/POST methods on endpoints that are redirected because of a
     trailing slash.  #3579(3)

   - Drop the processed task from ‘all_tasks()’ list early.  It prevents
     logging about a task with unhandled exception when the server is
     used in conjunction with ‘asyncio.run()’.  #3587(4)

   - ‘Signal’ type annotation changed from
     ‘Signal[Callable[['TraceConfig'], Awaitable[None]]]’ to
     ‘Signal[Callable[ClientSession, SimpleNamespace, ...]’.  #3595(5)

   - Use sanitized URL as Location header in redirects #3614(6)

   - Improve typing annotations for multipart.py along with changes
     required by mypy in files that references multipart.py.  #3621(7)

   - Close session created inside ‘aiohttp.request’ when unhandled
     exception occurs #3628(8)

   - Cleanup per-chunk data in generic data read.  Memory leak fixed.
     #3631(9)

   - Use correct type for add_view and family #3633(10)

   - Fix _keepalive field in __slots__ of ‘RequestHandler’.  #3644(11)

   - Properly handle ConnectionResetError, to silence the “Cannot write
     to closing transport” exception when clients disconnect uncleanly.
     #3648(12)

   - Suppress pytest warnings due to ‘test_utils’ classes #3660(13)

   - Fix overshadowing of overlapped sub-application prefixes.
     #3701(14)

   - Fixed return type annotation for WSMessage.json() #3720(15)

   - Properly expose TooManyRedirects publicly as documented.  #3818(16)

   - Fix missing brackets for IPv6 in proxy CONNECT request #3841(17)

   - Make the signature of ‘aiohttp.test_utils.TestClient.request’ match
     ‘asyncio.ClientSession.request’ according to the docs #3852(18)

   - Use correct style for re-exported imports, makes mypy ‘--strict’
     mode happy.  #3868(19)

   - Fixed type annotation for add_view method of UrlDispatcher to
     accept any subclass of View #3880(20)

   - Made cython HTTP parser set Reason-Phrase of the response to an
     empty string if it is missing.  #3906(21)

   - Add URL to the string representation of ClientResponseError.
     #3959(22)

   - Accept ‘istr’ keys in ‘LooseHeaders’ type hints.  #3976(23)

   - Fixed race conditions in _resolve_host caching and throttling when
     tracing is enabled.  #4013(24)

   - For URLs like “unix://localhost/…” set Host HTTP header to
     “localhost” instead of “localhost:None”.  #4039(25)

