13.5.3.322 Features
...................

   - Speed up the ‘PayloadWriter.write’ method for large request bodies.
     (#2126(1))

   - StreamResponse and Response are now MutableMappings.  (#2246(2))

   - ClientSession publishes a set of signals to track the HTTP request
     execution.  (#2313(3))

   - Content-Disposition fast access in ClientResponse (#2455(4))

   - Added support to Flask-style decorators with class-based Views.
     (#2472(5))

   - Signal handlers (registered callbacks) should be coroutines.
     (#2480(6))

   - Support ‘async with test_client.ws_connect(...)’ (#2525(7))

   - Introduce 'site' and 'application runner' as underlying API for
     ‘web.run_app’ implementation.  (#2530(8))

   - Only quote multipart boundary when necessary and sanitize input
     (#2544(9))

   - Make the ‘aiohttp.ClientResponse.get_encoding’ method public with
     the processing of invalid charset while detecting content encoding.
     (#2549(10))

   - Add optional configurable per message compression for
     ‘ClientWebSocketResponse’ and ‘WebSocketResponse’.  (#2551(11))

   - Add hysteresis to ‘StreamReader’ to prevent flipping between paused
     and resumed states too often.  (#2555(12))

   - Support ‘.netrc’ by ‘trust_env’ (#2581(13))

   - Avoid to create a new resource when adding a route with the same
     name and path of the last added resource (#2586(14))

   - ‘MultipartWriter.boundary’ is ‘str’ now.  (#2589(15))

   - Allow a custom port to be used by ‘TestServer’ (and associated
     pytest fixtures) (#2613(16))

   - Add param access_log_class to web.run_app function (#2615(17))

   - Add ‘ssl’ parameter to client API (#2626(18))

   - Fixes performance issue introduced by #2577.  When there are no
     middlewares installed by the user, no additional and useless code
     is executed.  (#2629(19))

   - Rename PayloadWriter to StreamWriter (#2654(20))

   - New options 'reuse_port', 'reuse_address' are added to ‘run_app’
     and ‘TCPSite’.  (#2679(21))

   - Use custom classes to pass client signals parameters (#2686(22))

   - Use ‘attrs’ library for data classes, replace ‘namedtuple’.
     (#2690(23))

   - Pytest fixtures renaming, add ‘aiohttp_’ prefix (#2578(24))

   - Add ‘aiohttp-’ prefix for ‘pytest-aiohttp’ command line parameters
     (#2578(25))

