13.5.3.325 Deprecations and Removals
....................................

   - Simplify HTTP pipelining implementation (#2109(1))

   - Drop ‘StreamReaderPayload’ and ‘DataQueuePayload’.  (#2257(2))

   - Drop ‘md5’ and ‘sha1’ finger-prints (#2267(3))

   - Drop WSMessage.tp (#2321(4))

   - Drop Python 3.4 and Python 3.5.0, 3.5.1, 3.5.2.  Minimal supported
     Python versions are 3.5.3 and 3.6.0.  ‘yield from’ is gone, use
     ‘async/await’ syntax.  (#2343(5))

   - Drop ‘aiohttp.Timeout’ and use ‘async_timeout.timeout’ instead.
     (#2348(6))

   - Drop ‘resolve’ param from TCPConnector.  (#2377(7))

   - Add DeprecationWarning for returning HTTPException (#2415(8))

   - ‘send_str()’, ‘send_bytes()’, ‘send_json()’, ‘ping()’ and ‘pong()’
     are genuine async functions now.  (#2475(9))

   - Drop undocumented ‘app.on_pre_signal’ and ‘app.on_post_signal’.
     Signal handlers should be coroutines, support for regular functions
     is dropped.  (#2480(10))

   - ‘StreamResponse.drain()’ is not a part of public API anymore, just
     use ‘await StreamResponse.write()’.  ‘StreamResponse.write’ is
     converted to async function.  (#2483(11))

   - Drop deprecated ‘slow_request_timeout’ param and ‘**kwargs'’ from
     ‘RequestHandler’.  (#2500(12))

   - Drop deprecated ‘resource.url()’.  (#2501(13))

   - Remove ‘%u’ and ‘%l’ format specifiers from access log format.
     (#2506(14))

   - Drop deprecated ‘request.GET’ property.  (#2547(15))

   - Simplify stream classes: drop ‘ChunksQueue’ and
     ‘FlowControlChunksQueue’, merge ‘FlowControlStreamReader’
     functionality into ‘StreamReader’, drop ‘FlowControlStreamReader’
     name.  (#2555(16))

   - Do not create a new resource on ‘router.add_get(…,
     allow_head=True)’ (#2585(17))

   - Drop access to TCP tuning options from PayloadWriter and Response
     classes (#2604(18))

   - Drop deprecated ‘encoding’ parameter from client API (#2606(19))

   - Deprecate ‘verify_ssl’, ‘ssl_context’ and ‘fingerprint’ parameters
     in client API (#2626(20))

   - Get rid of the legacy class StreamWriter.  (#2651(21))

   - Forbid non-strings in ‘resource.url_for()’ parameters.  (#2668(22))

   - Deprecate inheritance from ‘ClientSession’ and ‘web.Application’
     and custom user attributes for ‘ClientSession’, ‘web.Request’ and
     ‘web.Application’ (#2691(23))

   - Drop ‘resp = await aiohttp.request(…)’ syntax for sake of ‘async
     with aiohttp.request(…) as resp:’.  (#2540(24))

   - Forbid synchronous context managers for ‘ClientSession’ and test
     server/client.  (#2362(25))

