   - Fix polls demo run application (#1487(5))

   - Ignore unknown 1XX status codes in client (#1353(6))

   - Fix sub-Multipart messages missing their headers on serialization
     (#1525(7))

   - Do not use readline when reading the content of a part in the
     multipart reader (#1535(8))

   - Add optional flag for quoting ‘FormData’ fields (#916(9))

   - 416 Range Not Satisfiable if requested range end > file size
     (#1588(10))

   - Having a ‘:’ or ‘@’ in a route does not work (#1552(11))

   - Added ‘receive_timeout’ timeout for websocket to receive complete
     message.  (#1325(12))

