     now (#479(3))

     N.B. Backward incompatible change: was ‘.close(force=False) Using
     'force’ parameter for the method is deprecated: use ‘.release()’
     instead.

   - Properly requote URL’s path (#480(4))

   - add ‘skip_auto_headers’ parameter for client API (#486(5))

   - Properly parse URL path in aiohttp.web.Request (#489(6))

