     Python 3.4.1 (#541(15))

   - Add ‘async with’ support for ‘ClientSession.request()’ and family
     (#536(16))

   - Ignore message body on 204 and 304 responses (#505(17))

   - ‘TCPConnector’ processed both IPv4 and IPv6 by default (#559(18))

   - Add ‘.routes()’ view for urldispatcher (#519(19))

   - Route name should be a valid identifier name from now (#567(20))

   - Implement server signals (#562(21))

   - Drop a year-old deprecated 'files' parameter from client API.

   - Added ‘async for’ support for aiohttp stream (#542(22))

