13.6.1 Third-Party libraries
----------------------------

aiohttp is not just a library for making HTTP requests and creating web
servers.

It is the foundation for libraries built 'on top' of aiohttp.

This page is a list of these tools.

Please feel free to add your open source library if it’s not listed yet
by making a pull request to ‘https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/’

   * Why would you want to include your awesome library in this list?

   * Because the list increases your library visibility.  People will
